      "en": "merchant",
      "note": "any business that accepts payments, especially small shops on a payment platform. Collocations: 小微商户, 商户收款, 商户号 (merchant ID), 商户服务, 拓展商户 (merchant acquisition).",
      "examples": [
        {
          "zh": "很多小商户用二维码收款。",
          "py": "Hěn duō xiǎo shānghù yòng èrwéimǎ shōukuǎn.",
          "en": "Many small merchants collect payments by QR code."
        },
        {
          "zh": "我家楼下的商户都可以用手机付款。",
          "py": "Wǒ jiā lóu xià de shānghù dōu kěyǐ yòng shǒujī fùkuǎn.",
          "en": "All the shops downstairs from my home accept mobile payment."
        },
        {
          "zh": "这个月新开户的商户比上个月多了百分之十五。",
          "py": "Zhège yuè xīn kāihù de shānghù bǐ shàng ge yuè duōle bǎi fēn zhī shíwǔ.",
          "en": "Newly onboarded merchants this month were up 15% on last month."
